core":7,"comment_zh":"Pinterest 擁有強大的品牌認知度，其視覺化的內容發現平台吸引了大量用戶，尤其在設計、家居、時尚等領域。這種品牌吸引力使其在廣告業務中具有一定的定價能力，能夠吸引尋求特定受眾的廣告商。然而，相較於 Google 或 Meta 等巨頭，其品牌在整體互聯網廣告市場的絕對主導地位仍有差距，定價權的堅固性有待加強，尤其是在面對競爭對手時。","comment_en":"Pinterest boasts strong brand recognition, with its visual content discovery platform attracting a large user base, particularly in areas like design, home decor, and fashion. This brand appeal grants it some pricing power in its advertising business, attracting advertisers seeking specific demographics. However, compared to giants like Google or Meta, its absolute dominance in the overall internet advertising market is still developing, and the robustness of its pricing power needs further strengthening, especially when facing competitors."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"Pinterest 的核心業務模式，即內容聚合與用戶互動，較少依賴專利保護。其技術優勢更多體現在算法推薦和用戶體驗的持續優化上，而非可專利化的硬體或獨特技術。在監管方面，雖然面臨數據隱私和內容審核的挑戰，但並未構成顯著的特許經營壁壘。相較於醫藥或科技領域，其專利和監管壁壘相對薄弱。","comment_en":"Pinterest's core business model, focusing on content aggregation and user interaction, relies less on patent protection. Its technological advantages lie more in algorithmic recommendations and continuous user experience optimization rather than patentable hardware or unique technologies. While facing challenges in data privacy and content moderation, regulatory aspects do not constitute a significant barrier to entry. Compared to sectors like pharmaceuticals or deep tech, its patent and regulatory moats are relatively weak."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"用戶在 Pinterest 上的轉換成本相對較低。雖然用戶會花時間整理個人畫板、關注特定內容，但若有更吸引人的平台出現，轉移的門檻不高。對於廣告商而言，雖然需要時間適應新平台，但若能達到更好的廣告效益，轉換也是可行的。因此，其轉換成本壁壘屬於中等水平，不足以形成強大的用戶或客戶黏性。","comment_en":"The switching costs for users on Pinterest are relatively low. While users invest time curating boards and following specific content, the barrier to migrate to a more appealing platform is not prohibitively high. For advertisers, although adaptation to a new platform takes time, switching is feasible if better advertising outcomes can be achieved. Therefore, its switching cost moat is moderate, not sufficient to create strong user or customer stickiness."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Pinterest 展現了顯著的網絡效應。用戶越多，平台上的內容和創意就越豐富，這反過來吸引更多用戶和廣告商。廣告商的加入也增加了平台的商業化內容，為用戶提供更多元的購物和發現機會。這種正向循環效應，尤其是在內容發現和用戶參與度方面，構成了重要的競爭壁壘，使得後來者難以複製其龐大的活躍用戶基礎和豐富的內容生態。","comment_en":"Pinterest exhibits significant network effects. A larger user base leads to richer content and creativity on the platform, which in turn attracts more users and advertisers. The addition of advertisers also enhances the platform's commercialization, offering users more diverse shopping and discovery opportunities. This positive feedback loop, particularly in content discovery and user engagement, forms a crucial competitive barrier, making it difficult for newcomers to replicate its vast active user base and rich content ecosystem."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"作為一個領先的視覺發現平台，Pinterest 在規模上具有一定的成本優勢。其龐大的用戶基礎和數據量有助於優化廣告投放算法和內容推薦系統，從而降低單位用戶的獲客和運營成本。然而，與互聯網巨頭相比，其在基礎設施和研發投入上的規模經濟效應可能相對較弱。其成本優勢主要體現在運營效率和廣告精準度上。","comment_en":"As a leading visual discovery platform, Pinterest benefits from certain economies of scale. Its large user base and data volume help optimize ad-targeting algorithms and content recommendation systems, thereby reducing customer acquisition and operational costs per user. However, compared to internet behemoths, its economies of scale in infrastructure and R&D investment might be relatively weaker. Its cost advantage primarily manifests in operational efficiency and ad precision."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"Pinterest 的業務模式並未顯著依賴特定的地理位置或獨特的實體資產。其平台具有高度的全球擴展性，用戶和內容可以跨越國界。雖然在某些地區可能擁有較高的市場滲透率，但這更多是市場策略的結果，而非基於不可複製的地理或資產壁壘。因此，這方面的護城河較為薄弱。","comment_en":"Pinterest's business model does not significantly rely on specific geographic locations or unique physical assets. Its platform is highly scalable globally, with users and content transcending borders. While it may have high market penetration in certain regions, this is more a result of market strategy than an unreplicable geographic or asset-based barrier. Consequently, the moat in this dimension is relatively weak."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Pinterest 在運營效率方面表現出色，尤其是在將用戶流量轉化為廣告收入方面。其廣告系統不斷優化，能夠更精準地匹配用戶興趣和廣告商需求，從而提高廣告轉化率和客戶滿意度。持續的技術投入和數據分析支持了其運營效率的提升，使其在盈利能力上展現出堅實的基礎。","comment_en":"Pinterest demonstrates strong operational efficiency, particularly in converting user traffic into advertising revenue. Its advertising system is continuously optimized to more accurately match user interests with advertiser demands, thereby improving conversion rates and customer satisfaction. Ongoing investment in technology and data analytics supports its operational efficiency, providing a solid foundation for profitability."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Pinterest 近期展現出更為審慎和有效的資本配置策略。公司專注於核心業務的增長和盈利能力的提升，並開始回購股票，顯示出對自身價值的信心。相較於過去可能更側重於擴張，現在的策略更為務實，旨在為股東創造長期價值。雖然歷史上可能存在一些投資效率不彰的時期，但目前的趨勢顯示出管理層在資本配置上的能力正在增強。","comment_en":"Pinterest has recently demonstrated a more prudent and effective capital allocation strategy. The company is focusing on core business growth and profitability enhancement, and has initiated share buybacks, indicating confidence in its own valuation. Compared to a past emphasis on expansion, the current strategy is more pragmatic, aiming to create long-term shareholder value. While there may have been periods of less efficient investment historically, current trends suggest management's capital allocation capabilities are strengthening."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Pinterest 在用戶留存方面表現穩健，其獨特的內容發現和靈感激發功能，使得用戶習慣於定期訪問以獲取創意和規劃。雖然用戶活躍度可能受季節性或趨勢影響，但其平台的核心價值主張——提供視覺靈感和購物連結——能夠有效維持用戶的長期參與。廣告商的留存也受益於平台的精準投放和不斷增長的用戶基礎。","comment_en":"Pinterest shows solid user retention, with its unique content discovery and inspiration-generating features encouraging regular visits for creative ideas and planning. While user activity might fluctuate seasonally or with trends, the platform's core value proposition—providing visual inspiration and shopping connections—effectively maintains long-term user engagement. Advertiser retention is also bolstered by the platform's precise targeting and growing user base."},"m10_durability":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Pinterest 的商業模式具有一定的持久性，其視覺化內容發現的定位在互聯網領域獨樹一幟，不易被輕易顛覆。然而，科技行業的快速變化意味著其仍需不斷創新以應對新興的社交媒體、電商平台和內容形式的挑戰。其核心價值在於連接用戶的興趣與商業機會，這種連接的持久性取決於其持續適應用戶偏好和技術發展的能力。","comment_en":"Pinterest's business model possesses a degree of durability; its niche in visual content discovery is unique in the internet landscape and not easily disrupted. However, the rapid pace of technological change necessitates continuous innovation to counter challenges from emerging social media, e-commerce platforms, and content formats. Its core value lies in connecting user interests with commercial opportunities, the longevity of which depends on its ability to adapt to evolving user preferences and technological advancements."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Pinterest 的經濟護城河主要建立在其強大的網絡效應和用戶黏性之上，尤其是在視覺內容發現和靈感激發領域。其品牌認知度為廣告業務提供了基礎，而運營效率則支持了盈利能力的提升。然而，相較於互聯網巨頭，其在專利、轉換成本和規模經濟方面壁壘相對較弱。整體而言，Pinterest 類似於一個擁有強大社區效應的『內容發現與廣告平台』，而非傳統意義上的特許經營或收費橋。其護城河的堅固性取決於能否持續擴大用戶基礎、深化內容生態，並有效應對日益激烈的市場競爭與技術變革。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Pinterest's economic moat is primarily built upon its strong network effects and user engagement, particularly in visual content discovery and inspiration. Its brand recognition provides a foundation for its advertising business, while operational efficiency supports profitability. However, compared to internet behemoths, its barriers in patents, switching costs, and economies of scale are relatively weaker. Overall, Pinterest resembles a 'content discovery and advertising platform' with potent community effects, rather than a traditional franchise or toll bridge. The moat's durability hinges on its ability to continuously expand its user base, deepen its content ecosystem, and effectively navigate intense market competition and technological shifts.","evidenceHash":"e62f367511b006b74b72b41d3365bb25826ea0faf656370342c258d24db588b5","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":7,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"54d377feef454517f0a0cc906fce54f9dd462610cedcdf3ee2e18303c5840318"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"54d377feef454517f0a0cc906fce54f9dd462610cedcdf3ee2e18303c5840318"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/PINS.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/PINS.png","website":"https://www.pinterest.com","ceo":"William J. Ready","full_time_employees":"5116","description":"Pinterest, Inc. functions globally as a platform dedicated to visual discovery. Its core purpose is to empower individuals to unearth inspiration for various aspects of their lives, encompassing everything from culinary creations and personal style to home decor and do-it-yourself ventures. The platform facilitates this through diverse content formats, including video, product, and concept-based \"Pins.\" Leveraging sophisticated visual machine learning, Pinterest provides personalized recommendations tailored to each user's unique preferences and interests. Established in 2008, the company was initially known as Cold Brew Labs Inc. before officially changing its name to Pinterest, Inc. in April 2012. Its corporate headquarters are located in San Francisco, California.","description_en":"Pinterest, Inc. functions globally as a platform dedicated to visual discovery. Its core purpose is to empower individuals to unearth inspiration for various aspects of their lives, encompassing everything from culinary creations and personal style to home decor and do-it-yourself ventures. The platform facilitates this through diverse content formats, including video, product, and concept-based \"Pins.\" Leveraging sophisticated visual machine learning, Pinterest provides personalized recommendations tailored to each user's unique preferences and interests. Established in 2008, the company was initially known as Cold Brew Labs Inc. before officially changing its name to Pinterest, Inc. in April 2012. Its corporate headquarters are located in San Francisco, California.","description_zh":"**Pinterest, Inc. (PINS) 業務營運概述**\n\nPinterest, Inc. 是一家全球性的視覺探索平台，旨在協助使用者發掘生活各面向的靈感，涵蓋美食、個人風格、居家佈置及 DIY 等多元領域。其核心產品為「Pin」，一種結合影片、商品及概念的視覺內容格式。\n\n公司透過先進的視覺機器學習技術，為每位使用者提供個人化推薦，精準匹配其獨特偏好與興趣。此營運模式透過吸引大量使用者產生與分享內容，進而吸引廣告商投放精準廣告，形成雙邊市場的獲利結構。\n\nPinterest 成立於 2008 年，總部位於美國加州舊金山。其平台不僅是內容分享的空間，更是一個連結使用者需求與商業機會的生態系，透過持續優化演算法與內容呈現方式，深化使用者體驗並拓展商業化潛力。","address":"505 Brannan Street","city":"San Francisco","state":"CA","zip":"94107","country":"US","phone":"415 762 7100","full_address":"505 Brannan Street, San Francisco, CA 94107, US","range_52w":"13.84-35.42","year_high":35.42,"year_low":13.84,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":13.84,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-21","name":"Rajaram Gokul","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":1050,"price":22.84,"total_val":0.02},{"date":"2026-10-21","name":"Silbermann Benjamin","title":"director, 10 percent owner: ","is_buy":null,"action":"C-Conversion","shares":46875,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-21","name":"Silbermann Benjamin","title":"director, 10 percent owner: ","is_buy":null,"action":"C-Conversion","shares":46875,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-21","name":"S